      ],
      "explanation": "<p>The complexes with formula [Mabcd]<sup>n±</sup> can have three geometrical isomers. As NO<sup>2−</sup> and SCN<sup>−</sup> are ambidentate ligands, therefore 4 × 3 = 12 geometrical isomers will be possible.</p>"
